  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "材料缺陷學",
    "sub_ename": "DEFECTS IN MATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "介紹材料中缺陷的本質以及缺陷對材料可能之影響。本課程將以點缺陷之探討為主，包含其成因、控制、與影響等。進而以其他缺陷的探討為輔，並藉由自主學習配合主題報告，期使學生對材料缺陷有進一步之認識與理解。而自主學習之目的在於深化課程學習。",
    "describe_eh": "To introduce mainly the characteristics of defects in materials and influences of defects on materials. This class will start from discussions of point defects, including formation mechanisms, process control, influences, etc. Other defects will also be discussed. Self-directed to broaden student’s horizons. The objective of self-directed learning is to deepen the learning of the course work.",
